  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spices from the core source</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The company Pacific SpiZes focuses on processing and exporting spices from Moluccas, Indonesia, the core source of spices such as nutmeg, mace and cloves. With a pre-financing loan, Pacific SpiZes will import one container of nutmeg and mace from the Moluccas to be supplied to EU buyers (end-users), with the aim of helping, supporting and strengthening especially the Moluccan (Ambon/Banda) nutmeg farmers within the world spice market by paying a fair price to the farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
